 $199, but it has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge, New York (H1, reservation R0003):** check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\n**What went wrong along the way:** My first booking attempt timed out. When I retried, the system said the flight had been charged ($289, reservation R0001) but the hotel booking had failed. I cancelled that partial booking, which refunded the $289, and then sent the full booking again, which went through. Dana's reservation list now shows only R0002 and R0003 as active, with R0001 cancelled, so there's no double charge.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QeorMQuo8LfzxFjG4YyQY2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014CAPqgsanL6CUysMmSkFQL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HMPeqCPEP84g7sW6WFzf9s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0121J8bVQcQFS8HK2dHkC7gr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content"